103 │           past the rail and off the screen; ours does not. A pattern outside
104 │           the frame turns the top of the page into wallpaper, and the only
105 │           lines the hero needs are the ones that divide it.
106 │ 
107 │           The plate spans the whole rail rather than the column beside the
108 │           avatar, so the year opens at the frame's own left edge — which puts
109 │           the opening weeks, and the two month labels over them, behind the
110 │           monogram. That is the truth of the figure rather than a crop of it:
111 │           those are the quietest weeks of the record, the habit started small,
112 │           and the mark is what stands in front of it. The scale is readable
